  "solution": "The logic followed here is : **(1st number × 2) + 2nd number = 3rd number**\n\nSo,\n\n \n• Option - (1) : (14 - 28 - 42)\n\n​(14 × 2) + 28 = 42\n\n28 + 28 = 42\n\n**52 ≠ 42 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (16 - 32 - 64)\n\n​(16 × 2) + 32 = 64\n\n32 + 32 = 64\n\n64 = 64 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (18 - 36 - 72)\n\n​(18 × 2) + 36 = 72\n\n36 + 36 = 72\n\n72 = 72 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (12 - 24 - 48)\n\n(12 × 2) + 24 = 48\n\n24 + 24 = 48\n\n48 = 48 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, **\"Option - (1)\"** is the correct answer.\n\n8f:T",
